      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What kind of skills do participants develop at URRAAN?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Participants at URRAAN have developed a range of skills, including management, communication, and both hard and soft skills. The programs aim to build skills from basic to advanced levels, fostering personal and professional growth."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What kind of career opportunities do URRAAN participants find after their programs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Many URRAAN participants secured paid internships or jobs in various companies after completing their programs. These roles included web developers, graphic designers, and social media marketers in firms like Seven Software Technologies, Financial Unlimited, and Edenspell."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Did URRAAN help people with freelancing careers?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, several testimonials show that URRAAN training programs helped participants in their freelancing careers. Some individuals became Level 1 or Level 2 sellers on Fiverr, improving their productivity and earning potential."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who is URRAAN suitable for?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "URRAAN is particularly suitable for individuals who have recently completed their bachelor's degree or are in their last semester. It offers a great opportunity for those who have the potential to polish their skills in the IT field."
      }
    }
